{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16886","headline":"旬假南亭寄熊郎中 · 武元衡","name":"旬假南亭寄熊郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旬休屏戎事，凉雨北窗眠。\n江城一夜雨，万里绕山川。\n草木散幽气，池塘鸣早蝉。\n妍芳落春後，旅思生秋前。\n红槿粲庭艳，绿蒲繁渚烟。\n行歌独谣酌，坐发朱丝弦。\n哀玉不可扣，华烛徒湛然。\n闻君乐林卧，郡阁旷周旋。\n酬对龙象侣，灌注清泠泉。\n如何无碍智，犹苦病缠牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}